'''Candy Corn''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was obtainable in the [[Halloween Event 2025|2025 Halloween Event]] by purchasing the [[2025 Halloween Box]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
The blade of this knife has various hues of light pink and purple, going from lightest to gradually darkest. There are numerous cheery looking candy corns on the blade. The guard is a shiny orange, while handle is in the shade of pitch black. 

== Trivia ==

* It has a [[Candy Corn Gun (2025)|partner gun]] under the same name.

